{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/34264-time-capsule-of-ww-newsgroups","id":34264,"title":"Time Capsule of WW newsgroups","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-20T20:24:05-08:00","id":34264,"title":"Time Capsule of WW newsgroups","content":"Not sure if this has been discussed before but as I was googling something about Blood and Smoke, I stumbled upon Google's Groups service. One of the top results was a thread from rockin' 1994 so I did some snooping around and there's actually WW announcements of the -then under development- nWoD and things older still!<br /> <br /> Anyone looking for a good nostalgia trip, head over there and toy with the advanced search settings to select specific milestones in WW history, so you can read what was the sort of zeitgeist of the community back then!<br /> <br /> Have fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.greece-bynight.com\" target=\"_blank\">Greece By Night LARP</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/59-stylanski","name":"stylanski","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar59_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"299"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-20T20:31:14-08:00","id":34269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> [08/10/1993] <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Well, in my opinion, the best one of them all (and the only one I have, actually)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">is a game called Ars Magica. It is based on the concept of a Magus, and the</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">whole system revolves around the art of magic. There are some mundanes too, but</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">mainly magi. It is a game I HIGHLY reccoment.</span></span> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Games I know WW makes:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Werewolf<br /> + many supplements<br /> Vampire<br /> + many supplements<br /> Ars Magica<br /> + many supplements<br /> World of Darkness (not out yet)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">and there is one more in this 'StoryTeller' series...no?</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">--Andrew<br /> (and I meant the ars-magica mailing list, btw)</span></span> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">\u200b</span></span><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topicsearchin/alt.games.whitewolf/before$3A1993$2F10$2F31|sort:date|spell:true/alt.games.whitewolf/BsuRIVIdd3s\" target=\"_blank\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!to...lf/BsuRIVIdd3s</a><br /> Don't know about you guys but for me this is freakin' beautiful!</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.greece-bynight.com\" target=\"_blank\">Greece By Night LARP</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/59-stylanski","name":"stylanski","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar59_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"299"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-20T21:55:32-08:00","id":34291,"title":"","content":"Actually, I've been aware of Google Groups since Google became a site (<i>Quickly ditched Alta Visa because man, was that search engine a pain to deal with back in the day.</i>).<br /> <br /> If you want to look up old White Wolf newsgroups, there's:<br /> alt.games.whitewolf.rage<br /> alt.games.jyhad<br /> rec.games.frp.storyteller<br /> alt.games.whitewolf<br /> alt.games.whitewolf.mage<br /> alt.games.vampire.the.masquerade<br /> <br /> Personally, my favorite is the Coming Attractions FAQ by Rick Jones. There's some odd stuff in there that never saw the light of day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T01:42:04-07:00","id":92694,"title":"","content":"I remember those newsgroups (Sniff)...good memories. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Peace.<br /> <br /> <br /> ~ N","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is timing in everything. Timing in strategy cannot be mastered without a great deal of practice. There is also timing in the Void. You win battles with the timing in the Void born of the timing of cunning by knowing the enemies' timing, and thus using a timing which the enemy does not expect.&quot; <i>Shinmen Musashi no Kami Fujiwara no Genshin, Go Rin No Sho (The Book of the Five Rings)</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2141-nadrakas","name":"Nadrakas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2141_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}